{"name":"Risen Monk","size":"medium","type":"Undead","tag":"","alignment":"chaotic evil","hitDice":"7","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":4,"otherArmorDesc":"11 (natural armor)","speed":"20","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"45 (7d8 + 14)","speedDesc":"20 ft.","strPoints":"16","dexPoints":"8","conPoints":"15","intPoints":"7","wisPoints":"10","chaPoints":"14","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"4","customCr":"3 (700 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The venomous mummy can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The venomous mummy regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the venomous mummy can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the venomous mummy can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The venomous mummy can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the venomous mummy's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the venomous mummy's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the venomous mummy dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Adhael's Blood Plague","desc":"[MON]'s form is unstable and only partially on this plane. [MON] has disadvantage on saving throws against conjuration spells and vulnerability to force damage.\n\nHowever, [MON] can also cast _Etherealness_ once per day, and has advantage on charisma checks when interacting with spiritual creatures."},{"name":"Undead Fortitude","desc":"If damage reduces the [MON] to 0 hit points, it must make a Constitution saving throw with a DC of 5 + the damage taken, unless the damage is radiant or from a critical hit. On a success, the [MON] drops to 1 hit point instead."},{"name":"Blood Frenzy","desc":"The [MON] has advantage on melee attack rolls against any creature that doesn't have all its hit points."}],"actions":[{"name":"Fist","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [STR 1d6] bludgeoning damage plus [1d6] poison damage."},{"name":"Contagion","desc":"_Melee Spell Attack:_ +5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ The target takes [1d12] poison damage and is poisoned. The [MON] is then destroyed.\n\nAt the end of each of the poisoned target’s turns, the target must make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw. If the target succeeds on three of these saves, it is no longer poisoned, and the spell ends. If the target fails three of these saves, the target is no longer poisoned, but choose one of the diseases below. The target contracts **Adhael's Blood Plague**."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[{"name":"Plague Spreader.","desc":"When [MON] is destroyed, it explodes in a 15ft sphere. Creatures within the sphere must make a DC 13 dexterity saving throw or take [2d6] poison damage, or half as much on a success."}],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"con","order":2}],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[{"name":"bludgeoning","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"force","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"},{"name":"necrotic","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"},{"name":"piercing","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"poison","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[{"name":"charmed"},{"name":"exhaustion"},{"name":"frightened"},{"name":"paralyzed"},{"name":"poisoned"}],"languages":[],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":1,"damage":[]}